sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Mon as Health monitor
    participant Orc as DR orchestrator
    participant Tr as Traffic control
    participant RA as Region A (primary)
    participant RB as Region B (standby)
    participant Data as Replication
    loop steady state
        RA->>Data: stream writes
        Data->>RB: apply, track lag
    end
    Mon->>Orc: region A failing health checks
    Orc->>Data: what is the replication lag?
    Data-->>Orc: lag = the data you are about to lose
    alt lag within RPO
        Orc->>RB: promote to primary
        Orc->>Tr: shift traffic to region B
        Tr-->>Orc: cutover complete, RTO clock stops
    else lag beyond RPO
        Orc->>Orc: hold, escalate — failing over would lose committed writes
    end
